---TITLE---
Chronotecture · The Great Step Countdown Calendar
---CSS---
---BODY---
  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="kicker">Lost Science of Prophetic Engineering · The Great Step · Plates&nbsp;97 &amp; 99</div>
    <h1>Chronotecture
      <span class="sub">The Great Step — 126&nbsp;P″ of limestone, 1902 to 2028&nbsp;AD, then the red granite</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="prov">A rebuild of the Great Step chronology Breshears gives in his text (plates&nbsp;97 and 99, book pages&nbsp;121 and&nbsp;123), with every date and measurement preserved verbatim; only the visual language is new. There is no single plate for it: the drawn alignments are on charts&nbsp;XXVII and XXVIII (plates&nbsp;83–84). Its structural key: <b>the Great Step is a limestone block 126&nbsp;P″ long</b>; at one pyramid-inch per year from its face in <b>1902&nbsp;AD</b> it counts “120 + 6” years, three periods of 42, to <b>2028&nbsp;AD (5922&nbsp;AM)</b>, the final limestone year. The red granite floor begins in 2029&nbsp;AD.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="toolbar" id="filters"><span class="lbl">Filter</span></div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>The countdown, inch by inch</h2>
      <div class="hint">1&nbsp;P″ = 1 year. Limestone from 1902 to 2028&nbsp;AD, ticked every inch and divided into three 42-year periods; the latent dates of the 43rd and 103rd inch below; the red granite after 2028. Hover or tap a marker. <span class="anchor-key"><i></i>FACE OF THE GREAT STEP 1902 AD</span></div>
      <div class="swipe">⟷ swipe to pan the timeline</div>
      <div class="scroller" data-focus=".4"><svg id="tl" class="wide" viewBox="0 0 1400 440" role="img" aria-label="The Great Step countdown, 1902 to 2052 AD"></svg></div>
    </div>
    <div class="bottom">
      <div class="card"><h2>Cycle mathematics</h2><div class="hint">The arithmetic written in the text, checked (AM&nbsp;=&nbsp;AD&nbsp;+&nbsp;3894; 1&nbsp;AM&nbsp;=&nbsp;3895&nbsp;BC). Figures that do not hold are kept and marked <i>as written</i>.</div><div class="mathgrid">
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">120 + 6 = 126 · 1902 + 120 = 2022</span><span class="cap">“A 120 + 6 year period”: ten 12-year (144-month) periods from 1902 to 2022&nbsp;AD, then “the 6 years remaining”.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">1902 + 126 = 2028 AD (5922 AM)</span><span class="cap">The final limestone year; the red granite floor begins in 2029&nbsp;AD.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">42 × 3 = 126 · 1944 · 1986 · 2028</span><span class="cap">“Subdivided into three 42 year periods.”</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">2028 − 1776 = 252 = 36 × 7</span><span class="cap">“The 252nd year (36x7:360x7) of the United States.”</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">2052 − 2028 = 24 · 2028 + 12 = 2040</span><span class="cap">24 years before the Seven Kings are released; half of it ends at 2040&nbsp;AD, planet Phoenix.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">1902 + 43 = 1945 AD (5839 AM)</span><span class="cap">The 43rd P″, aligned with the North Wall of the Lower Chamber.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">1902 + 103 = 2005 AD (5899 AM)</span><span class="cap">103&nbsp;P″ from the face, aligned with the South Wall of the Middle Chamber.</span></div>
        <div class="mrow"><span class="eq">5899 AM = “last year of the 118th Jubilee”</span><span class="cap">Counted from Man’s banishment from Eden in 3895&nbsp;BC (1&nbsp;AM).</span><span class="aw">as written — 118 × 50 = 5900, so the 118th jubilee runs 5851–5900&nbsp;AM and its last year is 5900&nbsp;AM (2006&nbsp;AD); 5899&nbsp;AM is its 49th year</span></div>
      </div><div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">Read together with chart&nbsp;I, whose Ascendant Passage reaches the face of the Great Step at 1902&nbsp;AD [5796&nbsp;AM], and chart&nbsp;XXVII (plate&nbsp;83), which draws this block.</div></div>
      <div class="card"><h2>Full transcription</h2><div class="hint">The source passages, verbatim from the text plates (their spelling kept).</div><details class="tx"><summary>Show transcription</summary><div class="cols">
        <div><h3>Plate 97 (book page 121)</h3><ul><li>The Great Step is a huge limestone block 126 P" in length that exhibits the same .6 variance that the length of the Descendant Passage does, at 4146 P.</li><li>Thus, the Great Step, as a foundation (beginning) to this timeline covers a 120 + 6 year period (120 being the genatria for Hebrew word foundation).</li><li>This countdown is comprised of ten 12-year (144 months) periods starting with 1902 AD … initiated a 120 year calendar to the fulfillment of this curse against the United States in 2022 AD.</li></ul></div>
        <div><h3>Plate 99 (book page 123): the end of the limestone</h3><ul><li>We are left with the 6 years remaining (6 is the number of Man) to the end of the limestone Great Step block for a total of 126 P". This indicates ythe year 2028 AD (5922 AM)</li><li>This is the 252nd year (36x7:360x7) of the United States when it detonates a weapon more powerful than any nuclear weapon thus far detonated … In this year also a manned spacecraft will succeed in an unprecedented mission.</li><li>2028 AD is the final limestone year, the following year, 2029 AD, begins the red granite floor which denotes the active presence of Anunnakion Earth.</li><li>2028 AD is exactly 24 years before the Seven Kings are released in 2052 AD. Half of this 24 year period ends at 2040 AD, the year the planet Phoenic returns to the inner system … the Sixth Seal judgement.</li></ul></div>
        <div><h3>Plate 99: the three 42-year periods</h3><ul><li>The 126 P" length of the Great Step chronology is subdivided into three 42 year periods (42x3 is 126).</li><li>The first 42 years ends at 1944 AD when the USA sent B-29 Superfortresses bombing cities of Japan and also initiated D-Day … 174,000 American troops from 5000 ships … The largest nbaval battle in world history was also faught in this year when 218 Allied vessels faught 64 Japanese ships.</li><li>The next 42 years period ended at 1986 AD (already detailed) and the final one of course at 2028 AD.</li></ul></div>
        <div><h3>Plate 99: the latent dates</h3><ul><li>The North Wall of the Lower Chamber is aligned with the 43rd P" of the Step, giving us the year 1945 AD (5839 AM) when Germany fell to the Allied Forces, the USA first tested a nuclear device at New Mexico … US bombers dropped atmoic weapons over Hiroshima nad Nagasaki. The United Nations is founded …</li><li>The other date indicated by a vertical line drawn down to the South Wall of the Middle Chamber lies exactly 103 P" from the face of the Great Step, which reveals that to us the year 2005 AD (5899 AM), the last year of the 118th Jubilee from Man’s Banishment from Eden in 3895 BC (1 AM).</li><li>The year 2005 was a year of storms: hurricanes Katrina and Rita … Astronomers take the first direct photograph of a exoplanet … An amazing crop formation appeared encoded clearly the sum of 7344, the entire length of the Great Pyramid’s chronometrical timeline!</li><li>All of these alignments can be seen on Plate XXVII and XXVIII.</li></ul></div>
      </div></details><div class="foot">Source: J.&nbsp;M.&nbsp;Breshears, <i>Chronotecture: Lost Science of Prophetic Engineering</i> (2017), the Great Step chronology (plates&nbsp;97 and 99; charts&nbsp;XXVII–XXVIII). Content transcribed unchanged; this is an interpretive redraw for study, not an endorsement of the underlying claims.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
---JS---
const CAT={
  lime:{c:'#c9b98f',label:'Limestone periods'},
  war:{c:'#9c8bf0',label:'War & nations'},
  latent:{c:'#f08a4b',label:'Latent dates'},
  proph:{c:'#e7c355',label:'Granite & prophecy'}
};
const YMIN=1896, YMAX=2058, PL=60, PR=1340;
const X=y=>PL+(y-YMIN)/(YMAX-YMIN)*(PR-PL);
const svg=document.getElementById('tl'), AX=X(1902), BY=160;
// limestone and granite bands
const lg=el('g',{class:'row','data-cat':'lime'});
lg.appendChild(el('rect',{x:AX,y:BY-20,width:X(2028)-AX,height:40,fill:'#1d2234',stroke:'#c9b98f'}));
tx(lg,(AX+X(2028))/2,BY+5,'LIMESTONE GREAT STEP · 126 P″ · 120 + 6',{'text-anchor':'middle',fill:'#c9b98f','font-size':12,class:'mono h'});
for(let y=1902;y<=2028;y++){const x=X(y),m=(y-1902)%42===0,t=(y-1902)%12===0;lg.appendChild(el('line',{x1:x,y1:BY-20,x2:x,y2:BY-20-(m?16:t?9:4),stroke:m?'#ffcf5c':t?'#aeb7cd':'#4a5a80','stroke-width':m?2:1}));}
[1902,1944,1986,2028].forEach((y,i)=>tx(lg,X(y),BY-42,String(y)+(i?' · '+(42*i)+' P″':''),{'text-anchor':'middle',fill:'#ffcf5c','font-size':11,class:'mono'}));
lg.appendChild(el('rect',{x:AX,y:BY-50,width:X(2028)-AX,height:70,fill:'transparent'}));
bind(lg,T('Limestone Great Step · 126 P″','#c9b98f','1902 → 2028 AD (5922 AM)','42×3 is 126: 1944 · 1986 · 2028 AD. Minor ticks every P″; taller ticks every 12 years (144 months), ten of them to 2022 AD, then the 6 years remaining.'));svg.appendChild(lg);
const gg=el('g',{class:'row','data-cat':'proph'});
gg.appendChild(el('rect',{x:X(2028),y:BY-20,width:X(2052)-X(2028),height:40,fill:'#2a1418',stroke:'#e0555f'}));
tx(gg,(X(2028)+X(2052))/2,BY+5,'RED GRANITE',{'text-anchor':'middle',fill:'#e0555f','font-size':11.5,class:'mono h'});
bind(gg,T('The red granite floor','#e0555f','begins 2029 AD','Denotes the active presence of Anunnaki on Earth. 2028 AD is exactly 24 years before the Seven Kings are released in 2052 AD.'));svg.appendChild(gg);
// face anchor
svg.appendChild(el('line',{x1:AX,y1:40,x2:AX,y2:420,stroke:'#ffcf5c','stroke-width':2.2}));
tx(svg,AX+8,52,'Face of the Great Step · 1902 AD',{fill:'#ffcf5c','font-size':13,class:'mono','font-weight':500});
// 120 bracket
const b=el('g',{class:'row','data-cat':'lime'});b.appendChild(el('path',{d:`M${AX} 90 V82 H${X(2022)} V90 M${X(2022)} 82 H${X(2028)} V90`,fill:'none',stroke:'#aeb7cd'}));
tx(b,(AX+X(2022))/2,76,'120 years · ten 12-year (144 months) periods → 2022 AD',{'text-anchor':'middle',fill:'#aeb7cd','font-size':11,class:'h'});
tx(b,X(2025),76,'+6',{'text-anchor':'middle',fill:'#aeb7cd','font-size':11,class:'mono'});
bind(b,T('120 + 6','#aeb7cd','1902 → 2022 → 2028 AD','“120 being the genatria for Hebrew word foundation”; “the 6 years remaining (6 is the number of Man)”.'));svg.appendChild(b);
const EV=[
 {y:1944,cat:'war',t:'1944 AD · first 42 years end',b:'B-29 Superfortresses bomb Japan; D-Day, Operation Overlord: 174,000 American troops from 5000 ships; 218 Allied vessels fought 64 Japanese ships.'},
 {y:1945,cat:'latent',t:'1945 AD (5839 AM) · 43rd P″',b:'Aligned with the North Wall of the Lower Chamber. Germany falls; first US nuclear test at New Mexico; Hiroshima and Nagasaki; the United Nations is founded.'},
 {y:1986,cat:'war',t:'1986 AD · second 42 years end',b:'“The next 42 years period ended at 1986 AD (already detailed).”'},
 {y:2005,cat:'latent',t:'2005 AD (5899 AM) · 103 P″',b:'Aligned with the South Wall of the Middle Chamber; “the last year of the 118th Jubilee” (as written: 118 × 50 = 5900, so 5899 AM is the 49th year). Hurricanes Katrina and Rita; a crop formation encoding 7344.'},
 {y:2028,cat:'proph',t:'2028 AD (5922 AM) · final limestone year',b:'The 252nd year (36x7:360x7) of the United States; a weapon more powerful than any nuclear weapon; a manned spacecraft succeeds in an unprecedented mission.'},
 {y:2040,cat:'proph',t:'2040 AD · planet Phoenix returns',b:'Half of the 24 years from 2028: Phoenix transits occulting the sun, the Sixth Seal judgement.'},
 {y:2052,cat:'proph',t:'2052 AD · Seven Kings released',b:'24 years after 2028 AD.'}
];
const LV={1944:0,1945:1,1986:0,2005:1,2028:2,2040:3,2052:4};
EV.forEach(e=>{const x=X(e.y),col=CAT[e.cat].c,ly=BY+64+LV[e.y]*38;
  const g=el('g',{class:'row','data-cat':e.cat});
  g.appendChild(el('line',{x1:x,y1:BY+20,x2:x,y2:ly-14,stroke:col,opacity:.6}));
  g.appendChild(el('circle',{cx:x,cy:BY+20,r:5,fill:col,stroke:'#0b0f1a','stroke-width':1.5}));
  tx(g,x,ly,e.t,{'text-anchor':e.y>=2028?'end':'middle',fill:col,'font-size':11.5,'font-weight':600,class:'h'});
  g.appendChild(el('rect',{x:x-8,y:BY+14,width:16,height:ly-BY-10,fill:'transparent'}));
  bind(g,T(e.t,col,'',e.b));svg.appendChild(g);});
for(let y=1900;y<=2050;y+=10)tx(svg,X(y),410,String(y),{'text-anchor':'middle',fill:'#5d6885','font-size':10,class:'mono'});
chips(CAT,'.row');
